al":169143,"en":"It was not merely your horses, my Kalmyk;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l009","ordinal":169144,"en":"I seized your herds as well."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l010","ordinal":169145,"en":"When I sacked your three cities,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l011","ordinal":169146,"en":"When I raided and took your monks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l012","ordinal":169147,"en":"I cut off"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l013","ordinal":169148,"en":"Your monks' topknots entirely."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l014","ordinal":169149,"en":"I took a letter written in Chinese;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l015","ordinal":169150,"en":"I gelded your monk and made him a mount."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l016","ordinal":169151,"en":"I brought a ruinous time upon you!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l017","ordinal":169152,"en":"I dug your grave deep;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l018","ordinal":169153,"en":"I hewed your road backward;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l019","ordinal":169154,"en":"I did wonders indeed!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l020","ordinal":169155,"en":"I traced many strange paths for you;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l021","ordinal":169156,"en":"I burned and destroyed five of your cities."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l022","ordinal":169157,"en":"I brought great humiliation upon you;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l023","ordinal":169158,"en":"Five of your daughters with forelocks"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l024","ordinal":169159,"en":"I took as booty."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l025","ordinal":169160,"en":"Have you now become a man?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l026","ordinal":169161,"en":"Have you mounted a horse, looming there?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l027","ordinal":169162,"en":"Yesterday, after traveling seven years on foot,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l028","ordinal":169163,"en":"Above Jet-Kayt,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l029","ordinal":169164,"en":"I destroyed seven of your cities at once."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l030","ordinal":169165,"en":"I plundered much of your treasure;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l031","ordinal":169166,"en":"I stirred up much destructive turmoil."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l032","ordinal":169167,"en":"Eating seven batmans of wheat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l033","ordinal":169168,"en":"You reek of grain, Joloy;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l034","ordinal":169169,"en":"Having killed seventy giants,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l035","ordinal":169170,"en":"You reek of blood, Joloy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l036","ordinal":169171,"en":"Eating sixty batmans of wheat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l037","ordinal":169172,"en":"You reek of grain, Joloy;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l038","ordinal":169173,"en":"Having killed sixty giants,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b003:l039","ordinal":169174,"en":"You reek of blood, Joloy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l001","ordinal":169175,"en":"Akkula's prize—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l002","ordinal":169176,"en":"Do not take it away; leave it here!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l003","ordinal":169177,"en":"I am no Manas who will let it be taken;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l004","ordinal":169178,"en":"You are no Joloy who can take it!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l005","ordinal":169179,"en":"Because of this prize,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l006","ordinal":169180,"en":"I shall be steeped in bloody blood."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l007","ordinal":169181,"en":"My sprawling Black Kalmyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l008","ordinal":169182,"en":"I shall fight for six months without fleeing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l009","ordinal":169183,"en":"I shall divide your seven cities;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l010","ordinal":169184,"en":"I shall pursue you to the end and die fighting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l011","ordinal":169185,"en":"Tell of your red spear and its sheath;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l012","ordinal":169186,"en":"Fucking Chinese, tell the truth!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l013","ordinal":169187,"en":"With a battle cry, Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l014","ordinal":169188,"en":"Reached Khan Joloy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l015","ordinal":169189,"en":"He seized his black-bladed whip"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l016","ordinal":169190,"en":"And swung it around;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l017","ordinal":169191,"en":"Charging at Joloy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l018","ordinal":169192,"en":"He struck him across the jaw."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l019","ordinal":169193,"en":"His black malakay hat"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l020","ordinal":169194,"en":"Flew shrieking into the sky."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l021","ordinal":169195,"en":"When Manas attacked,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l022","ordinal":169196,"en":"Everyone now attacked."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l023","ordinal":169197,"en":"The sovereign old Bakai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l024","ordinal":169198,"en":"Chased and scattered the infidels,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l025","ordinal":169199,"en":"Who swarmed like black worms."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l026","ordinal":169200,"en":"Poor Joloy ran,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l027","ordinal":169201,"en":"Taking refuge among his Kalmyks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l028","ordinal":169202,"en":"Blood streaming from his jaw."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l029","ordinal":169203,"en":"A bruise as large as a horse's head rose;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l030","ordinal":169204,"en":"He barely bound his jaw with a scarf."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l031","ordinal":169205,"en":"A bruise as large as a yurt rose;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l032","ordinal":169206,"en":"Groaning, he bound his jaw with a scarf."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l033","ordinal":169207,"en":"The strongest of the jacketed Chinese"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l034","ordinal":169208,"en":"Asked him what had happened:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l035","ordinal":169209,"en":"“Warrior leopard of the Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l036","ordinal":169210,"en":"What happened to your jaw?” they asked."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l037","ordinal":169211,"en":"“His father Kyrgyz, his mother Sart,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l038","ordinal":169212,"en":"The slave Manas who resembles an Argyn,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1219:b005:l039","ordinal":169213,"en":"Who gnaws frozen apples—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1220:b003:l001","ordinal":169214,"en":"That bastard born of foul urine,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1220:b003:l002","ordinal":169215,"en":"That shrieking Burut—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1220:b003:l003","ordinal":169216,"en":"It seems his way struck me;"}]
